# Exercise 1: Facts
#
# A fact states something that is true:
#
#     fact likes("Ana", "pizza")
#
# likes is the name of the relationship, and "Ana" and "pizza" are the
# things it relates. Text goes in double quotes. Once Sova has facts, it can
# answer questions about them, like: who likes pizza?
#
# Your task: add facts so that Sova knows
#   - Ana likes pizza
#   - Ben likes sushi
#   - Cy likes pizza
#
# Write your facts below this line.



# --- Checks: run ./sova --check on this file. Don't change below here. ---
hint "Each fact looks like: fact likes("Ana", "pizza")"
hint "Write one fact per line, three in all."
expect likes("Ana", "pizza")
expect likes("Ben", "sushi")
expect NOT likes("Ben", "pizza")
expect likes(who, "pizza") gives "Ana", "Cy"
expect likes("Cy", food) gives "pizza"
